@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> Adding Item : Add Item
Start --> Removing Item : Remove Item
Start --> Viewing Cart : View Cart
Start --> Updating Cart : Update Cart

Adding Item --> Item Added : Item Added
Removing Item --> Item Removed : Item Removed
Viewing Cart --> Cart Viewed : Cart Viewed
Updating Cart --> Cart Updated : Cart Updated

Item Added --> [*] : Return to Start
Item Removed --> [*] : Return to Start
Cart Viewed --> [*] : Return to Start
Cart Updated --> [*] : Return to Start
@enduml
